<title>USA: Sherwood declines comment on shr activity.</title>
<headline>Sherwood declines comment on shr activity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Tuesday that Sherwood Group Inc declined to comment on the unusual market activity in the company's stock.</p>
<p>The NYSE contacted Sherwood and requested that it issue a public statement indicating any corporate developments that may explain the activity, the exchange said.</p>
<p>Sherwood Group's shares traded at 14-1/2, up 1-1/4 for the day. The company's stock is trading over its 52-week high of 13-1/4.</p>
</text>
